CrossPoint Reader — private PlatformIO libraries.

Each top-level subdirectory under lib/ is compiled as a static library and
linked into the firmware. Sources live in the module directory itself
(for example lib/Epub/, lib/Xtc/Xtc/), not under a src/ subfolder.

hal/ provides hardware abstraction and is excluded in the simulator environment.

third_party/ holds vendored upstream code registered via lib_extra_dirs in
platformio.ini. See third_party/README for package versions and usage.

PlatformIO's Library Dependency Finder resolves #includes and optional
library.json dependency edges (for example lib/Markdown/library.json).

Additional dependencies come from platformio.ini lib_deps and open-x4-sdk
symlinks.

https://docs.platformio.org/page/librarymanager/ldf.html
